==Rules==
{{StageRule|12thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*4 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Baa Baa]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Baa Baa]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 34.67 seconds<sup>1,040f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 48 seconds<sup>1,440f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Baa Baa]] spawns after 63.33 seconds<sup>1,900f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
You can beat this stage by spamming [[Mr. (Special Cat)|Super Mr.]].

==Trivia==
*Koyo Domain is named after the Japanese word 紅葉 ''kōyō'' (autumn leaves).

